  "changes": [
    "Publish immutable direct-raw and material-footprint tables once; retain thread-confined structural capacity memo references in prepared snapshots and copy the memo on replay.",
    "Canonicalize recipes with at most eight input slots in sorted scratch storage, preserving exact overflow and stateful-input exclusions.",
    "Cache immutable host-feedback-seed presence and recompute it for recipe projections.",
    "Prove a strict reverse topological material order before allocating SCC structures; retain the existing SCC path for missing ranks, self-loops and backward edges.",
    "Preserve identity source groups and stable capacity ties while avoiding singleton member lists, repeated group-maximum scans and small-group general sorting."
